    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fan game that's easy to enjoy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the simple gameplay of shooting and hitting in a pinball game,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there\u2019s no need to understand complicated rules!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot freely wherever you like and clear the game together with the talents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The content of the broadcasts is related to the talents' activities,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so if you understand all the references, you might be a model fan of the talents...!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155810/extras/f34500160a33066b324dd39e57263e14.poster.avif?t=1733411057\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155810/extras/f34500160a33066b324dd39e57263e14.webm?t=1733411057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155810/extras/f34500160a33066b324dd39e57263e14.mp4?t=1733411057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's liven up the broadcasts and increase the number of subscribers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The broadcast gets more exciting as listeners empathize with the talents' actions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the broadcast becomes more lively, the number of concurrent viewers, likes, and comments will increase,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and you\u2019ll clear the broadcast when you connect with all the listeners!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of new channel subscribers will increase as the broadcast becomes more exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various elements to liven up the broadcast:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each talent has unique action skills,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so try using them at the right moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Successfully using these skills allows you to connect with more listeners,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bringing you closer to a successful broadcast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also special skills that can only be used in special broadcasts, so don't miss out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-rating gimmicks placed in each stage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >will increase likes when hit, so aim for them actively!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other gimmicks are also hidden, so use them for a successful broadcast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155810/extras/71beecdba6557f86aba509b7b29d88a4.poster.avif?t=1733411057\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155810/extras/71beecdba6557f86aba509b7b29d88a4.webm?t=1733411057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155810/extras/71beecdba6557f86aba509b7b29d88a4.mp4?t=1733411057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155810/extras/cf610b2aebb5d9757237e40be1135782.poster.avif?t=1733411057\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155810/extras/cf610b2aebb5d9757237e40be1135782.webm?t=1733411057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155810/extras/cf610b2aebb5d9757237e40be1135782.mp4?t=1733411057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim for the high score!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can earn more points by connecting with many listeners in a single action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or by clearing the broadcast with fewer actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predict the placement of listeners and the bounce of actions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and utilize action skills and gimmicks to aim for the high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ranking ended on December 5, 2024! Thank you to everyone who participated in the challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is published under CCMC Corp(\u203b1)'s Indie game brand &quot;holo Indie&quot;.(\u203b2)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is allowed to be monetized under the examination and terms of &quot;holo Indie&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that any monetized derivative work games that include Cover Corp.'s content outside of holo Indie is not covered by these terms and is not allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b1. About CCMC Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CCMC Corp. is entrusted with website management (ex: steam) including, examination, publishing and other necessary tasks by Cover Corp.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b2. About &quot;holo Indie&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >holo Indie's objective is to cooperate with hololive production fans and creators.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a game brand that offers &quot;Game Creator Support Program&quot; for the derivative work games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more details about &quot;holo Indie&quot;, Please refer to the Cover Corp.'s &quot;Derivative work guidelines&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3155810/extras/127dcdd3f0103f3954ec8b12ca78a915.avif?t=1733411057\" width=800 height=190 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NexTone License Number: GS000001765,ID000010050</p>",
